# Ionospheric Scintillation Detection (Python MVP)

## Recommended Environment (Conda)
```powershell
conda env create -f environment.yml
conda activate isd-mvp
pip install -e .[dev]
```

## Run Desktop App
```powershell
conda run -n isd-mvp python -m isd
```

## P1-07 Highlights
- `系统设置`页支持默认算法参数、阈值预设、接收机阈值预设的编辑与保存。
- `数据计算`页支持任务模板保存/应用（含覆盖策略）并显示配置来源：
  - `manual`
  - `template`
  - `default`

## P1-08 Highlights
- Provider 依赖判定已接入 `validateTask`，返回 `providerSummary/providerChainHint`。
- 结果元数据已回填 provider 来源摘要（可在结果详情卡与报告预览中查看）。

## Core Validation Commands
```powershell
# Unified P0 quality gate (pytest + step12 + demo)
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_p0_gate.py

# Unit + integration tests
conda run -n isd-mvp pytest -q

# Step12 regression gate
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_step12_gate.py

# Step12 regression gate (explicit dataset matrix)
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_step12_gate.py --datasets 24084,24085

# End-to-end MVP demo
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_mvp_demo.py

# Freeze snapshot (gate + demo + consolidated status)
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_release_freeze.py

# Final Step12 closeout (acceptance sign-off + freeze archive zip)
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_step12_closeout.py --signed-by <owner_name>

# Windows release gate
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/run_windows_release_gate.py

# Build Windows portable package
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/build_windows_release.py

# Collect diagnostics bundle
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/collect_diagnostics.py --workspace workspace

# Build demo report (PDF by default, auto-fallback to txt when needed)
conda run -n isd-mvp python scripts/build-report-demo.py --project-id <project_id>
```

## Key Artifacts
- P0 gate summary: `workspace/reports/p0_gate_summary.json`
- Step12 summary: `workspace/reports/regression_step12_summary_24084.json`
- Step12 matrix summary: `workspace/reports/regression_step12_summary_matrix.json`
- MVP demo summary: `workspace/reports/mvp_demo_summary.json`
- Freeze snapshot: `workspace/reports/release_freeze_snapshot.json`
- Step12 closeout summary: `workspace/reports/step12_closeout_summary.json`
- Acceptance sign-off: `workspace/reports/mvp_acceptance_signoff.json`
- Windows release gate summary: `workspace/reports/windows_release_gate_summary.json`
- Windows portable package output: `workspace/releases/windows/`
- Freeze archives: `workspace/releases/freeze/`

